    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/9ff102f78c66ebd093445c61578538ac.avif?t=1741384074\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bet your own life in a poker dice game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down to play poker dice against cheating deities. Whoeveer loses will be forced to shoot itself with a revolver... \u00bfwhat can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/cc05edb4ebcf8200b7b69a267e4040a9.poster.avif?t=1741384074\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/cc05edb4ebcf8200b7b69a267e4040a9.webm?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/cc05edb4ebcf8200b7b69a267e4040a9.mp4?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy dice with powerful effects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+30 dice with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+7 cheating opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/1430b7313f360fb5a778f72ea75c12be.poster.avif?t=1741384074\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/1430b7313f360fb5a778f72ea75c12be.webm?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/1430b7313f360fb5a778f72ea75c12be.mp4?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle against the Seven Deadly Sins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They won't play fair. You will have to find dice with powerful effects to combine them in order to create synergies. Otherwise, you won't be able to win them in their own game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/ee99addb121d6e717969adcd2c2b6b35.poster.avif?t=1741384074\" width=680 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/ee99addb121d6e717969adcd2c2b6b35.webm?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/ee99addb121d6e717969adcd2c2b6b35.mp4?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/9ff102f78c66ebd093445c61578538ac.avif?t=1741384074\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bet your own life in a poker dice game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down to play poker dice against cheating deities. Whoeveer loses will be forced to shoot itself with a revolver... \u00bfwhat can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/cc05edb4ebcf8200b7b69a267e4040a9.poster.avif?t=1741384074\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/cc05edb4ebcf8200b7b69a267e4040a9.webm?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/cc05edb4ebcf8200b7b69a267e4040a9.mp4?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy dice with powerful effects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+30 dice with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+7 cheating opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/1430b7313f360fb5a778f72ea75c12be.poster.avif?t=1741384074\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/1430b7313f360fb5a778f72ea75c12be.webm?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/1430b7313f360fb5a778f72ea75c12be.mp4?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle against the Seven Deadly Sins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They won't play fair. You will have to find dice with powerful effects to combine them in order to create synergies. Otherwise, you won't be able to win them in their own game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/ee99addb121d6e717969adcd2c2b6b35.poster.avif?t=1741384074\" width=680 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/ee99addb121d6e717969adcd2c2b6b35.webm?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459890/extras/ee99addb121d6e717969adcd2c2b6b35.mp4?t=1741384074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2>",
    "short_description": "Take part in intense games of &quot;poker dice,&quot; where you must bet your life in a game of Russian roulette. Your opponents will cheat. If you want to survive, you\u2019ll have to cheat too. Good luck.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain",
